  "description": "I was sentenced to death and died.\n\n\"It's a bit of a waste to let you die as a villainess. How about it? I would like to give you a chance.\"\n\nNo, I thought I had died. But was it because of what that enemy-like bastard said right before my death?\n\n\"Geron, you son of a bitch...!\"\n\nWhen I opened my eyes, I had regressed ten years into the past—and into a different world, at that! Since I've been brought back to life anyway, it can't be helped. To make sure I don't repeat my foolish past...\n\n(Source: Kakao Entertainment, translated)",
